      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BILLY BLINDERS (8) recorded her best time this course and distance latest, finishing a 1.5 lengths second behind Federal Mercury in 17.52. Happy to have her on top here. BEAUTIFUL BANTER (4) struggled in tougher grade last start after settling well back at this track, but prior to that won by 2.5 lengths at this track (17.48) beating Zipping Tanaka in a Grade 4/5 on November 14. The form from her last run stacks up well. Cannot be taken lightly. RUN ROLEX (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (23.63) in a Grade 5 at The Gardens. Has a good record at this journey. Leading chance. ANGELIC BAROQUE (2) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
